`0.1 + 0.2`: what does this print?

```javascript
console.log(0.1 + 0.2);
console.log(0.1 + 0.2 === 0.3);
console.log((0.1 + 0.2).toFixed(2) === "0.30");
console.log(Math.abs(0.1 + 0.2 - 0.3) < Number.EPSILON);
console.log(0.5 + 0.25 === 0.75);
```

`[1, 2, 3] + [4]`: what does this print?

```javascript
console.log([1, 2, 3] + [4]);
console.log([] + []);
console.log([1] + 1);
console.log([2] * [3]);
console.log({} + "x");
```

Hoisting inside a function: what does this print?

```javascript
var x = "global";

function show() {
  console.log(x);
  var x = "local";
  console.log(x);
}

show();
console.log(x);
```

Mixing strings and numbers: what does this print?

```javascript
