A promise resolved inside a timer: what does this print?

```javascript
const p = new Promise((resolve) => {
  console.log(1);
  setTimeout(() => {
    console.log(2);
    resolve(3);
  }, 0);
  console.log(4);
});

p.then((value) => console.log(value));
console.log(5);
```

A closure counter with a getter: what does this print?

```javascript
const counter = (() => {
  let count = 0;
  return {
    inc: () => ++count,
    get value() { return count; },
  };
})();

counter.inc();
counter.inc();
const { value } = counter;
counter.inc();
console.log(value, counter.value);
```

`delete` on an array and changing `length`: what does this print?

```javascript
const arr = [1, 2, 3, 4];
delete arr[1];
console.log(arr, arr.length, 1 in arr);

arr.length = 2;
console.log(arr);

arr[5] = 6;
console.log(arr.length, arr);
```
